    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In context",
     "texto": [
      "«Daarom» introduces a consequence in the main clause; if it comes at the beginning, the verb goes after it: «Daarom neem ik een paraplu mee» (That's why I'm taking an umbrella). «Maar» links a simple contrast."
     ],
